urrence:2eb555e5b3999b7cdaae5004","observation_event_record_ids":["event_ace-m2-m4-implementation-2025-05-19"],"observation_relation_record_ids":["relation_ace-m2-m4-2025-05-19-affects-m2","relation_ace-m2-m4-2025-05-19-affects-m4","relation_ace-m2-m4-has-implementation-2025-05-19","relation_ace-m2-m4-may19-has-enforcement"],"occurrence_id":"occurrence:2eb555e5b3999b7cdaae5004","rationale":"The official MTA Open Data ACE route cut records M2 and M4 as one exact-day cohort whose program took effect on May 19, 2025; the official dataset dictionary defines implementation_date as the date the program took effect. June 2025 MTA performance materials and committee minutes corroborate that the five-route expansion was delivered, while the row-level cut keeps the May 19 cohort separate from the May 27 cohort. This decision resolves one realized ACE implementation occurrence with only M2 and M4 and one atomic automated_bus_lane_enforcement treatment. It does not reinterpret implementation as the start of fine-bearing enforcement, inherit the March forecast's planned April date, or import Jamaica, Bx35, future Madison Avenue, or unrelated umbrella-program scope.","reviewed_at":"2026-07-13T20:15:00.000Z","reviewer":"codex-corpus-completion-2026-07-13","schema_version":1}
